{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>據悉，這並非馬斯克首次表達對中文及中國市場的親近。11月7日，在第33屆巴倫投資大會上，馬斯克表示：「我覺得無論如何，學普通話都有一定價值。這是一門非常有趣的語言。」今年5月訪華期間，馬斯克也曾用中文發帖稱「我的兒子正在學習普通話」。</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1109/d51459a2255ce2f.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>此前，馬斯克接受央視財經專訪。談及特斯拉上海超級工廠時，他表示：「特斯拉上海工廠的成功，靠的是中國團隊。」他還稱，「特斯拉中國團隊人才濟濟、勤懇可靠，產品質量一流，生產效率極高。上海超級工廠是一塊瑰寶。」</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1109/62110bb41ca9ac6.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://static.cnbetacdn.com/article/2026/1109/d51459a2255ce2f.png\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T12:03:12.046415+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":3,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T11:21:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:48.505676+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T11:57:02.113686+00:00","content_hash":"4139fc22200a283b2a9b52285054466b81df7c4234c1fafb6644be4a413c90d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}